				<r3d:description language="eng">The Slovenian Social Science Data Archives (Slovenski Arhiv Družboslovnih podatkov - ADP) were established in 1997 as an organizational unit within the Institute of Social Sciences at the Faculty of Social Sciences, University of Ljubljana. Its tasks are to acquire significant data sources within a wide range of social science disciplines of interest to Slovenian social scientists, review and prepare them for digital preservation, and to disseminate them for further scientific, educational and other purposes.</r3d:description>
